{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34305","headline":"奉酬袭美秋晚见题二首 二 · 陆龟蒙","name":"奉酬袭美秋晚见题二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"何事乐渔樵，巾车或倚桡。\n和诗盈古箧，赊酒半寒瓢。\n失雨园蔬赤，无风蚛叶雕。\n清言一相遗，吾道未全消。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34305.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34305","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}